  "description": "Ring B data protection for the Goldpath enterprise asset: classify a property as personal/sensitive ONCE (attribute or code catalog) and every sink masks it consistently — audit change rows, redacted logging, Mediant audit patterns. Redaction composed from Microsoft.Extensions.Compliance (erasure default, HMAC pseudonymization opt-in). Masking, not encryption.",
